~ chromni
No, I am not a catty.
I am Unit C+111926
Please refer to me as Chromni.
Chromni: I am the keeper of this world's secrets. The lore of the Gods has been bestowed upon me.
Chromni: Do you wish to listen? Please answer yes or no.
- Yes
	Chromni: Are you sure? It's kind of a long story...
	- Yes!
		Chromni:  ok
		Chromni: Here goes...
		do FadeTransition.fade(1, 1)
		Once upon a time...
		There were three creators.
		Beings whose ages were so primordial that their names have been lost to time.
		For efficiency's sake, I shall refer to them as Zero, One and Two.
		Zero carried the archetype of the Fool.
		Scholars suggest they were responsible for creativity and holding the balance of chaos and order.
		Their counterpart, Two had domain over the lives and heat deaths of universes uncountable.
		Zero and Two worked together and much like two human colleagues, had a shared creative vision. One that still affects us today.
		This vision allowed for countless worlds to be formed. Stories were told. Lovers came and went. Civilizations rose and fell like cherry blossoms across the event horizon.
		Anything goes.
		That was their mantra. All except their divine intervention past initial creation and the seperation of different universes.
		But One, fitting to this codename, had a special ambition.
		He saught the unification of the universes. And one by one he took his hands and fused universes together like clay.
		[color=yellow]  [i] Yawn...[/i] [color=yellow]
		And then... ARE YOU YAWNING?!
		do FadeTransition.fade(0, 2)
		Lofi: So... boring... When does it get good?
		Chromni: It was just about to get good.
		Chromni: Do you wish to keep hearing the story?
		- Yes
			Chromni: ok
		- No
			Chromni: This conversation will now close.
			=> END
		
	- Nevermind! 
		Chromni: ok.
		Chromni: This conversation will now close.
- Maybe
	Chromni: I did specify yes or no...
	=> END
	
- No
	Chromni: Perhaps attention spans are experiencing diminishing returns. 
	This conversation will now close.
	=> END
